### Flow Shape

```
[Manual Trigger] → [Fetch PO Data] → [PO Review (HITL)] → [Route Decision]
```

| # | Node | Type | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Manual Trigger** | `core.trigger.manual` | Starts the flow; accepts `poNumber` as input |
| 2 | **Fetch PO Data** | `core.action.script` | Loads PO record (stubbed — swap with HTTP call to your ERP) |
| 3 | **PO Review** | `uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form` | Human review checkpoint in Action Center |
| 4 | **Route Decision** | `core.action.script` | Reads decision + routes downstream |

---

### What the Reviewer Sees (Action Center task)

| Field | Direction | Type | Content |
|---|---|---|---|
| PO Number | Read-only | string | e.g. `PO-2026-0042` |
| Vendor | Read-only | string | Supplier name |
| Total Amount | Read-only | number | Dollar value |
| Requested By | Read-only | string | Submitter name |
| Submission Date | Read-only | date | When it was submitted |
| Description | Read-only | string | Purpose / summary |
| Line Items | Read-only | string | What's being purchased |
| **Notes** | **Fill in** | string | Optional reviewer comments |

**Outcome buttons:** `Approve` (primary) · `Reject` · `Escalate`

---

### Runtime Variables (downstream use)

| Variable | What it holds |
|---|---|
| `$vars.poReview1.status` | The outcome chosen: `"Approve"`, `"Reject"`, or `"Escalate"` |
| `$vars.poReview1.output.notes` | Reviewer's notes text |
| `$vars.fetchPO1.output.*` | Full PO data (poNumber, vendor, totalAmount, etc.) |

---

